  "content": "<p data-pid=\"P2A5wK_s\">最近终于把俺妹补了，学了不少有趣的日语表现（不完全是谚语），比如：</p><p data-pid=\"5y51ay21\">諸悪の根源：万恶之源</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9b1d8288772bf01f279ad05b31f88427_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-9b1d8288772bf01f279ad05b31f88427\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-9b1d8288772bf01f279ad05b31f88427_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-9b1d8288772bf01f279ad05b31f88427\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-9b1d8288772bf01f279ad05b31f88427_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-9b1d8288772bf01f279ad05b31f88427_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"FICl_Red\">キモオタ：四斋蒸鹅心</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-670f250dd3f9fe66e0760ea0652be4cc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-670f250dd3f9fe66e0760ea0652be4cc\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-670f250dd3f9fe66e0760ea0652be4cc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-670f250dd3f9fe66e0760ea0652be4cc\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-670f250dd3f9fe66e0760ea0652be4cc_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-670f250dd3f9fe66e0760ea0652be4cc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"d-3G1rPL\">深窓の令嬢：深闺大小姐</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d457392b62ee4d01464e4014980f6d81_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-d457392b62ee4d01464e4014980f6d81\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-d457392b62ee4d01464e4014980f6d81_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-d457392b62ee4d01464e4014980f6d81\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-d457392b62ee4d01464e4014980f6d81_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d457392b62ee4d01464e4014980f6d81_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"JqFih_eK\">同じ穴のムジナ：一丘之貉</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d679da3df348589360b44d7b49f6af79_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-d679da3df348589360b44d7b49f6af79\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d679da3df348589360b44d7b49f6af79_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-d679da3df348589360b44d7b49f6af79\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d679da3df348589360b44d7b49f6af79_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d679da3df348589360b44d7b49f6af79_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ynr1Edjq\">付け焼刃：临阵磨枪</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-abc3c33b69b19fa2c6275f006101571e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-abc3c33b69b19fa2c6275f006101571e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-abc3c33b69b19fa2c6275f006101571e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-abc3c33b69b19fa2c6275f006101571e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-abc3c33b69b19fa2c6275f006101571e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-abc3c33b69b19fa2c6275f006101571e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"miMEFJPB\">にわか：跟风粉</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-105d54abdc54839f6155378873883c43_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-105d54abdc54839f6155378873883c43\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-105d54abdc54839f6155378873883c43_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-105d54abdc54839f6155378873883c43\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-105d54abdc54839f6155378873883c43_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-105d54abdc54839f6155378873883c43_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"hftqyBLZ\">借りパク：有借无还</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-111909aadd8a6ac37f5c041a6a9d73ed_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-111909aadd8a6ac37f5c041a6a9d73ed\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-111909aadd8a6ac37f5c041a6a9d73ed_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-111909aadd8a6ac37f5c041a6a9d73ed\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-111909aadd8a6ac37f5c041a6a9d73ed_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-111909aadd8a6ac37f5c041a6a9d73ed_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"dKBCGjIt\">K-ON 也挺多的，比如：</p><p data-pid=\"SdLGgw02\">足の踏み場もない：无立锥之地</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-837da9490c216946529a1cc23abc9804_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-837da9490c216946529a1cc23abc9804\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-837da9490c216946529a1cc23abc9804_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-837da9490c216946529a1cc23abc9804\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-837da9490c216946529a1cc23abc9804_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-837da9490c216946529a1cc23abc9804_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"vaOlZBc7\">お手のもの：拿手好戏</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-d5a8908703a4fb63bf2fea600a73d071_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-d5a8908703a4fb63bf2fea600a73d071\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d5a8908703a4fb63bf2fea600a73d071_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-d5a8908703a4fb63bf2fea600a73d071\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d5a8908703a4fb63bf2fea600a73d071_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-d5a8908703a4fb63bf2fea600a73d071_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"2nN6_7HC\">再起不能：再起不能（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f22017f91647e4a9d737eaa341c708ea_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-f22017f91647e4a9d737eaa341c708ea\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f22017f91647e4a9d737eaa341c708ea_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1954&#39; height=&#39;1284&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1954\" data-rawheight=\"1284\" data-original-token=\"v2-f22017f91647e4a9d737eaa341c708ea\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1954\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f22017f91647e4a9d737eaa341c708ea_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f22017f91647e4a9d737eaa341c708ea_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"GO_YU5kt\">太多了列不完了，感兴趣可以翻《実用日本語表現辞典》和《日本語俗語辞書》。</p>",
